            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1965] If the first ServiceDiscoveryRes message of the service session had the parameter ServiceRenegotiationSupported set to \"False\" and if the parameter EVSENotification in EVSEStatus is equal to \"ServiceRenegotiation\" in AC_ChargeLoopRes, the EVC shall not initiate a ServiceRenegotiation.",
